Python is a tool of choice for lots of data scientists, as it has a lot of math, stats

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:55.000
the machine learning libraries and it can work at a high level defining the actual task being

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:59.960
performed in straightforward code that can interface with low level libraries that crunch

